  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Ethics should be integrated into medical AI robot design from the concept stage ('ethics by design'), not added afterwards.",
   "Meaningful human control must be kept in telesurgery and other autonomous medical robotics.",
   "Traceability and explainability are needed so clinicians can audit AI decisions and so liability can be assigned.",
   "The 'moral crumple zone' problem shifts blame onto human surgeons, so liability rules and surgeon training are needed.",
   "Unified standards and a systematic ethical infrastructure are needed, with multidisciplinary collaboration."
